{
  "name": "Validate a new customer's VAT number and company before invoicing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate a new customer before invoicing\n\nChecks the customer's EU VAT number live in VIES (with the name you expect), then runs a counterparty check on the company: register status, insolvency, sanctions and whether the VAT number belongs to that company.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-boscolabs** (nodes panel, or Settings > Community Nodes).\n2. Get a Bosco Labs API key at [boscolabs.dev/api.html](https://boscolabs.dev/api.html#key) and save it as a **Bosco Labs API** credential.\n3. Pick that credential in each Bosco Labs node.\n4. Replace **New Customer** with your own trigger (CRM, form, webhook) that gives `customer_name`, `vat_number` and `country`.\n5. Connect your invoicing step after **OK to Invoice** and a message to your team after the other two outcomes.\n\n### Cost per customer\n$0.002 for the VAT check, plus $0.05 for the counterparty check when the VAT number is valid. Calls that return nothing are free.\n\n### Read the result with care\n`unverified` means a check could not be made (for example VIES was down, or the country has no open insolvency register). It does not mean the company is safe. The checks are a screening aid, not a compliance, credit or legal decision.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bbcf0a24-ce7e-5a4a-bd19-4648f67b2752",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "d4ec4f5e-457a-519e-a0c4-9e9ffd558f60",
